# CO-WP-JOURNEY-001 — Opportunity Creation · CERTIFIED · FROZEN

Status: **CERTIFIED** · **FROZEN** (includes 001A · 001B · 001C · 001D)

## Agent behaviour

1. Do **NOT** modify the Opportunity Creation Journey (`CreateOpportunityScreen`, journey config create path, create-only UX) unless the Product Owner explicitly instructs a change.  
2. Opportunity Workspace is **CO-WP-JOURNEY-002** (also frozen). Customer Workspace is **CO-WP-JOURNEY-003**.  
3. Do **not** reopen section/field architecture for create unless PO supersedes this freeze.

